54.text:
 Change which subdirectories are scanned for each module type: purr.moduleTypes = {
  nixos = ["nixos" "shared" "container" "nixos-musl"];
};

55.text:
 Inject external modules alongside auto-discovered ones: purr.extraModules = {
  nixos = [
    inputs.my-extra-modules.nixosModules.default
